{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他明知道回去未必能找回从前的亲近，却还是忍不住抱着重新靠近的希望。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"想念、期待、犹疑、害怕失去\",\n      \"missed\": \"他真正的选择是先把眼下日子过稳，不再只靠回头的希望忍让；即使以后可能独自扛事，仍然害怕、没底，却不打算收回决定。下方小字描述的试探、聚拢和向前，也需要读完才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍然留恋过去的亲近，但已经开始选择不再回头，先把自己的生活过好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、矛盾、恐惧、不安、勉强向前\",\n      \"missed\": \"他并不是已经不害怕了，而是即使担心以后独自承担事情，也不愿因为害怕而撤回刚才的打算。第二段后半部分的心理变化需要逐句读；下方动画的聚拢与前进也没有直接的叙事指向。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还会想念过去、幻想重新亲近的可能，但正在把重心转向当下，决定继续往前走。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、遗憾、害怕、没底、坚定中带着迟疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"他作出这个决定的具体心理过程：不愿只凭一点希望继续忍让，担心以后独自面对困难，却不想因此放弃眼下的打算。下方小字明确说明害怕仍在但脚步已经向前，这层意思不容易在一眼扫读时抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"第二段大字过长，而且与第一段几乎同等醒目，一眼看过去容易把它们都当成需要阅读的完整段落，先看什么不够明确。第一段已经传达了想回去的留恋，右上角绿色高亮也传达了先把日子过好的方向，但两者之间最重要的心理转折——仍然害怕、仍然没底，却决定不撤回打算——被埋在第二段的多层长句里。下方金色音符动画有运动感，底部小字也提供了向前走的解释，但动画本身与人物处境的联系不够直观。整体能串成一回事，但需要依赖第二段和底部小字的补充阅读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa4a1683-39a6-4b06-b554-e3e670ceffaf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T001516548934Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:16:29.418438+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "362cd24cfac1828c41e59956bd7e224a9819a7a50cce7cd400f98afa5ae09b5a", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T001516548934Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1484fd2aba9394cfe589778e773fe6d004b7ea8e7548d8cba436b3bd3f26db0d"}}}
